  },
  {
    "id": "c003",
    "name": "Recital – Lawsuit definition",
    "text": "Whereas Linooln General sued U.S. Auto, Gamma, CSi, Alpha, Doug Maxwell, Santa Fe and Jim Maxwell in the above entitled lawsuit (the “Lawsnit”); and"
  },
  {
    "id": "c004",
    "name": "Recital – Business solution",
    "text": "Whereas the Parties have apreed upon a business solution related to the current disputes that involves the payment, going forward, beginning May 4, 2009, of losses and all fees and expenses and costs associated in any way with the insurance policies reinsured by Lincoln General pursuant to the reinsurance relationship;"
  },
  {
    "id": "c005",
    "name": "I. Santa Fe to Reinsure Lincoln General – LPT",
    "text": "I, ‘Santa Fe to Reinsure Lincoln General. On or before June 30, 2009, Lincoln General and Santa Fe shall enter into a Loss Portfolio Transfer Reinsurance Agreement (“LPT”) whereby Santa Fe shall reinsure, indemnify, assume, and be liabie to Lincoln General for all past and futute losses, payments, risks, and habilities of Lincoln General arising in connection with the 2002 GAA, 2002 Q/S, 2003 GAA, 2003 Q/S, and all addenila to those agreements, whether or not such losses, payments, risks, and liabilities are known or can be ascertained at this time."
  },
  {
    "id": "c006",
    "name": "I. Prior-payment exclusion",
    "text": "Notwithstanding the foregoing, Santa Fe shall not be liable to Lincoln General under any LPT for payments completed prior to May 4, 2009 for losses on policies reinsured by Lirtcoln General."
  },
  {
    "id": "c007",
    "name": "I. Completed payment definition",
    "text": "For the purposes of this Memorandum of Understanding, a payment is considered to have been “completed” when the check or payment has been dated and issued by Sante Fe."
  },
  {
    "id": "c008",
    "name": "I. Continued use of ZBA",
    "text": "Lincoin General shall permit Santa Fe to continue fo utilize the existing Claims Zero Bafance Account (“ZBA”) until the LPT is executed, but no Ister than June 30, 2009."
  },
  {
    "id": "c009",
    "name": "I. No ZBA payments after execution",
    "text": "No. checks or payments shall be issued on the ZBA after the date of execution."
  },
  {
    "id": "c010",
    "name": "I. Reimbursement of ZBA payments",
    "text": "Santa Fe shall reimburse Lincoin General for all payments out ef the ZBA from May 4, 2009 until the date of execution."
  },
  {
    "id": "c011",
    "name": "II. Security for the LPT – Amount",
