    "id": "c017",
    "name": "III. Funding of Claims Handling",
    "text": "WU. Funding of Claims Handling Savta Fe shall fund all activities in conection with the investigation, settlement, contesting, or handling of claims related to the 2002 GAA, 2002 0/S, 2003 GAA, 2003 Q/S, and all addenda to those agreements."
  },
  {
    "id": "c018",
    "name": "III. Scope of funding obligations",
    "text": "It is understood and agréed that Santa Fe’s finding obligations shall include, but ot be limited to, al] claim payments, all attomey’s fees, other legal expenses, and any other expenses related to claims investigation, settlement, contesting, and handling,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c019",
    "name": "III. No effect on other obligations",
    "text": "It is further understyod and agreed that Santa Fe’s provision. of such funding shall not affect auy obligations of U.S. Auto, Gamma, or any othér defendant in the Lawenit with regard to the 2002 GAA, 2002 Q/S, 2003 GAA, 2003 Q/S, and all addenda to thidse agreements."
  },
  {
    "id": "c020",
    "name": "IV. Santa Fe to Pay Lincoln General $1.5 Million",
    "text": "IV. Santa Fe to Pay Lincoln General $1.5 Million Santa Fe shall pay Lincoln General $1.5 million."
  },
