  {
    "id": "c023",
    "name": "V. Dismissal Without Prejudice",
    "text": "V. Dismissal Without Prejudice _ Upon, execution of this Memorandum of Understanding, which the parties agree js sufficiently definite to allow the parties to sue for its enforcement, Lincoln General shall dismiss . Hts case without prejudice as to all defendants,"
