  {
    "id": "c026",
    "name": "VII. Regulatory Approval",
    "text": "VH. Regulatory Approval It is understood and agreed that this Memorandum of Understanding, and the matters to which it addresses, are subject to regulatory approval."
  },
  {
    "id": "c027",
    "name": "VIII. Review and Construction of Documents",
    "text": "VO. Review and Construction of Documents The Pasties agree that the terms of this Memorandum of Understanding shall be construed as ifjointly drafted by all Patties."
  },
  {
    "id": "c028",
    "name": "Section IX — Sole Remedy to Refile",
    "text": "Xk. In the Event of Failure to Complete the Required Actions under This Memorandum of Understanding or Later Breach In the event that the parties are not able to complete all of the actions required under this Memorandum of Understanding (such as final execution of the documentation contemplated herein, including but not limited to a mutually agreeable reinsurance agreement/LPT between Lincoln Geneml and Santa Fe, the settlement apresment contemplated by section X, or the posting of appropriate security), Lincoli’ sfremedy shall be to refile the lawsuit."
  },
  {
    "id": "c029",
    "name": "X. Settlement Agreement",
    "text": "X. Settlement Agreement See The Parties agree to draft a settlement ent to be executed along with the Santa Fe- LGIC reinsurance agreement that will, among other things, provide for releases of all Defendants based upon, Santa Fe’s satisfaction of the obligations in the reinsurance agreement/LPT, and of the obligations set forth in the settlement agreement."
